WEBVTT

00:17.510 --> 00:19.600
<b>What's the matter?</b>

00:23.730 --> 00:25.600
<b>Are you in pain?</b>

00:26.520 --> 00:28.320
<b>Well, that's not good.</b>

00:29.190 --> 00:31.860
<b>Here, let me comfort you.</b>

00:32.860 --> 00:34.360
<b>Hey.</b>

00:35.280 --> 00:37.370
<b>What are you doing to my wife?</b>

00:39.080 --> 00:41.790
<b>Nothing. I was just...</b>

00:45.500 --> 00:48.750
<b>Why don't we settle this with money?</b>

00:50.050 --> 00:52.050
<b>Forgive me!</b>

00:52.420 --> 00:55.300
<b>Anything, anything but this!</b>

00:55.510 --> 00:58.050
<b>You have no choice.</b>

02:13.250 --> 02:15.880
<b>Honjo, Sakura Estate</b>

02:18.550 --> 02:19.800
<b>Here you go.</b>

02:20.590 --> 02:25.980
<b>Lately every night, Tatsuzo's been out
with his bad friends again.</b>

02:26.980 --> 02:29.770
<b>It's good to blow off steam
from time to time.</b>

02:29.980 --> 02:31.480
<b>You keep saying that.</b>

02:32.150 --> 02:36.900
<b>He's becoming more and more
independent now.</b>

02:37.190 --> 02:40.740
<b>I can't tell if he's serious
about his sword training.</b>

02:40.950 --> 02:43.120
<b>That concerns me as well, but I'm sure</b>

02:43.330 --> 02:47.000
<b>one day, something will happen
to trigger his interest.</b>

02:48.160 --> 02:51.000
<b>In my case, it was a fellow student
of the sword.</b>

02:51.330 --> 02:54.090
<b>"Ginhei Takasugi's Hall"</b>

02:55.340 --> 02:57.260
<b>I'm Tetsusaburo Hasegawa!</b>

02:58.090 --> 03:00.180
<b>I joined the institution today.</b>

03:04.930 --> 03:08.930
<b>I'm Samanosuke Kishii. Nice to meet you.</b>

03:09.350 --> 03:14.690
<b>My skills improved because I discovered
joy in training with him.</b>

03:16.070 --> 03:20.200
<b>If only Tatsuzo had a good companion.</b>

03:23.780 --> 03:27.410
<b>Ojun, your mother looks disheartened
right now.</b>

03:31.830 --> 03:36.000
<b>There you go, that's my Ojun.</b>

03:40.550 --> 03:42.260
<b>It started to come down.</b>

03:42.470 --> 03:45.800
<b>-It might accumulate.
-Yeah.</b>

03:46.890 --> 03:50.140
<b>What are the townspeople raising
their voices about?</b>

03:50.350 --> 03:55.060
<b>It's been reported that lately ruffians
are going in and out</b>

03:55.230 --> 03:57.780
<b>of vassal, Kakunosuke Hattori's estate
in Honjo.</b>

03:57.940 --> 04:03.070
<b>Since they've been causing trouble
in the vicinity, people are asking for help.</b>

04:03.280 --> 04:05.620
<b>That area is known for evil vassals.</b>

04:05.820 --> 04:08.120
<b>They might be up to something.</b>

04:08.370 --> 04:09.620
<b>Absolutely.</b>

04:10.160 --> 04:12.580
<b>Understood. I'll investigate the area.</b>

04:12.790 --> 04:14.540
<b>I'm very familiar with Honjo.</b>

04:26.470 --> 04:28.060
<b>It's been 17 years</b>

04:28.720 --> 04:31.560
<b>since I moved away from here.</b>

04:37.900 --> 04:41.190
<b>It's still quiet in the early afternoon.</b>

05:46.800 --> 05:48.800
<b>Tetsusaburo, don't hesitate.</b>

05:49.010 --> 05:50.510
<b>Clinch a win with that sword.</b>

05:52.720 --> 05:55.980
<b>Samanosuke, don't hold back. Attack!</b>

06:16.710 --> 06:18.670
<b>Ofusa!</b>

06:20.830 --> 06:25.590
<b>My grandfather sent me to serve this
to the students.</b>

06:25.800 --> 06:27.630
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

06:33.720 --> 06:35.310
<b>Hits the spot.</b>

06:59.160 --> 07:02.460
<b>That was 20 years ago.</b>

07:12.590 --> 07:16.390
<b>Of course, it's Tetsu of Honjo.
He's still got it.</b>

07:17.470 --> 07:20.390
<b>Sama...? Samanosuke?</b>

07:20.600 --> 07:21.900
<b>That's right.</b>

07:22.310 --> 07:23.690
<b>Since when?</b>

07:23.900 --> 07:27.530
<b>I watched you walk in
from behind the dojo.</b>

07:27.730 --> 07:30.280
<b>Well, what a surprise.</b>

07:33.070 --> 07:34.490
<b>Do you frequent this place?</b>

07:34.700 --> 07:36.950
<b>From time to time.</b>

07:37.160 --> 07:40.620
<b>I'm still at Shunkeiji in Oshiage.</b>

07:40.830 --> 07:45.090
<b>You were deep in thought while you gazed
at the mountain cherry.</b>

07:45.250 --> 07:46.500
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:46.840 --> 07:49.130
<b>The Sakura Estate</b>

07:49.340 --> 07:51.930
<b>has changed hands now.</b>

08:07.650 --> 08:10.780
<b>I absolutely adore these cherry blossoms.</b>

08:12.400 --> 08:14.660
<b>Ofusa, I...</b>

08:18.120 --> 08:19.370
<b>You do too?</b>

08:20.250 --> 08:21.870
<b>Yes.</b>

08:31.300 --> 08:35.220
<b>I've been meaning to visit mentor
Takasugi's grave in Shimousa,</b>

08:35.430 --> 08:37.350
<b>but I've been on continuous duty.</b>

08:37.550 --> 08:40.020
<b>So what I've heard is true.</b>

08:40.220 --> 08:42.560
<b>Tetsu of Honjo has changed, I see.</b>

08:42.770 --> 08:46.360
<b>Even so, I never expected to run into you</b>

08:46.560 --> 08:49.440
<b>when I just decided to visit
out of nostalgia.</b>

08:50.280 --> 08:53.280
<b>Sama, do you remember our oath?</b>

08:54.070 --> 08:56.030
<b>How could I forget?</b>

09:01.500 --> 09:02.750
<b>Sama!</b>

09:03.370 --> 09:04.620
<b>Tetsu.</b>

09:04.790 --> 09:06.790
<b>What did you talk about with Ofusa?</b>

09:07.000 --> 09:08.920
<b>About the cherry blossoms.</b>

09:09.130 --> 09:11.460
<b>Don't even think about making
a move on her!</b>

09:11.840 --> 09:13.260
<b>That goes for you too!</b>

09:13.590 --> 09:15.260
<b>I'll kill you if you do.</b>

09:15.470 --> 09:16.760
<b>Likewise.</b>

09:17.430 --> 09:20.350
<b>In the end, we both had to watch Ofusa</b>

09:20.560 --> 09:22.770
<b>marry into the family of Oumiya.</b>

09:34.490 --> 09:36.030
<b>"Oumiya"</b>

09:37.740 --> 09:39.280
<b>There we go!</b>

09:39.990 --> 09:41.580
<b>All right!</b>

09:48.000 --> 09:49.750
<b>She was beautiful, wasn't she?</b>

09:49.960 --> 09:53.130
<b>Yeah, very beautiful.</b>

09:54.510 --> 09:58.010
<b>Time passes so quickly.</b>

09:58.220 --> 10:03.180
<b>But I'm still without a home, wife,
kids or money.</b>

10:03.720 --> 10:05.930
<b>All the dreams I entrusted to the sword</b>

10:06.140 --> 10:08.940
<b>have completely vanished.</b>

10:36.130 --> 10:37.670
<b>I'll be back.</b>

10:39.430 --> 10:40.680
<b>Boy, it's cold out here.</b>

10:41.300 --> 10:43.260
<b>Oh, is that...?</b>

10:44.510 --> 10:47.180
<b>What a day it's been.</b>

10:48.770 --> 10:50.690
<b>Hey, Hiko!</b>

10:54.360 --> 10:55.900
<b>It's me.</b>

10:58.610 --> 11:01.660
<b>Tetsu? Is that you?</b>

11:01.870 --> 11:05.160
<b>Yeah. I'm surprised you remembered me.</b>

11:05.740 --> 11:10.420
<b>What a respectable man you've become.</b>

11:10.920 --> 11:13.250
<b>I'm still good-for-nothing.</b>

11:13.590 --> 11:16.630
<b>Goodness, it's been so long.</b>

11:16.840 --> 11:21.510
<b>It's also been 17 years
since I last saw you.</b>

11:22.140 --> 11:25.100
<b>What do you mean by "also"?</b>

11:25.310 --> 11:27.850
<b>Oh, don't worry about it.</b>

11:28.680 --> 11:31.810
<b>By the way, the place
you came out of earlier</b>

11:32.020 --> 11:35.400
<b>is the estate of the vassal,
Kakunosuke Hattori, right?</b>

11:35.570 --> 11:36.940
<b>What's going on there?</b>

11:37.150 --> 11:43.320
<b>Sure, all the vassals in this area
are ruffians.</b>

11:43.740 --> 11:45.870
<b>I was there to gamble</b>

11:46.080 --> 11:48.620
<b>with the little money I made.</b>

11:48.830 --> 11:51.120
<b>I see. Well, drink up.</b>

11:51.540 --> 11:54.170
<b>Oh, I appreciate it.</b>

11:54.880 --> 11:58.000
<b>I'm so grateful that I can</b>

11:58.210 --> 12:02.220
<b>drink with you like this, Tetsu.
Just like the good old days.</b>

12:09.020 --> 12:12.770
<b>So tell me about this vassal, Hattori.</b>

12:13.440 --> 12:17.270
<b>He's notorious around here.</b>

12:18.980 --> 12:23.280
<b>He swindles money off people
by gambling.</b>

12:23.490 --> 12:25.780
<b>Since that doesn't satisfy him,</b>

12:25.990 --> 12:28.240
<b>he uses the ronin to steal from shops</b>

12:28.450 --> 12:31.410
<b>by charging an outrageous protection fee.</b>

12:31.620 --> 12:34.040
<b>If they don't pay, they'll end up</b>

12:34.250 --> 12:36.420
<b>getting beaten up by the gang.</b>

12:36.920 --> 12:40.260
<b>From what I hear, Kakunosuke's wife</b>

12:40.460 --> 12:43.180
<b>is also a piece of work.</b>

12:43.380 --> 12:45.930
<b>She gambles and drinks.</b>

12:46.720 --> 12:49.810
<b>If I remember correctly,
her name is Ofusa.</b>

12:52.350 --> 12:53.730
<b>Ofusa?</b>

12:55.440 --> 12:57.730
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

12:59.570 --> 13:00.820
<b>Actually,</b>

13:01.230 --> 13:04.240
<b>I'm on a special duty right now.</b>

13:04.450 --> 13:07.160
<b>What do you say?</b>

13:07.370 --> 13:10.290
<b>Will you help me out as an old friend?</b>

13:10.490 --> 13:13.460
<b>Of course! I'll do anything.</b>

13:13.660 --> 13:16.170
<b>Just tell me what you need me to do.</b>

13:16.370 --> 13:21.710
<b>For you, I'll gladly give up my stale life.</b>

13:22.170 --> 13:26.090
<b>Do not leak the information
that I'm about to tell you.</b>

13:26.300 --> 13:29.760
<b>Sure. And? What exactly is your duty?</b>

13:37.350 --> 13:38.610
<b>You're late.</b>

13:39.110 --> 13:43.110
<b>Sir, it's a disaster!</b>

13:43.320 --> 13:45.030
<b>What happened?</b>

13:46.200 --> 13:49.780
<b>I frequented Kakunosuke's estate
for a while since we last met.</b>

13:49.990 --> 13:55.040
<b>There, I boasted that I was a former
quack who was well-known in the vicinity.</b>

13:55.540 --> 13:57.540
<b>And then...</b>

13:58.250 --> 13:59.500
<b>Follow me.</b>

13:59.920 --> 14:03.170
<b>You're planning on burglarizing
a large store?</b>

14:03.670 --> 14:08.090
<b>You'll drown in the river
if you leak this information.</b>

14:08.300 --> 14:10.930
<b>Yes, I understand.</b>

14:11.140 --> 14:13.930
<b>Do you know a ronin who can handle this?</b>

14:14.140 --> 14:17.190
<b>A ronin? Not a thief?</b>

14:17.390 --> 14:19.940
<b>It doesn't have to be discreet.</b>

14:20.150 --> 14:24.360
<b>We'll slaughter everyone at the store
to leave no trace.</b>

14:24.570 --> 14:28.450
<b>Understood. And where is our target?</b>

14:30.910 --> 14:32.160
<b>Oumiya?</b>

14:32.530 --> 14:34.580
<b>Yes, that's what he said.</b>

14:37.540 --> 14:38.960
<b>I'm counting on you, Hiko.</b>

14:39.250 --> 14:40.830
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

14:43.630 --> 14:47.550
<b>-Who's there?
-This is Hikojyu.</b>

15:04.480 --> 15:06.320
<b>This is the Arson Theft Control!</b>

15:12.280 --> 15:14.080
<b>You'll die if you resist!</b>

15:44.400 --> 15:46.070
<b>Kakunosuke Hattori.</b>

15:46.570 --> 15:49.780
<b>Why did you decide to target Oumiya?</b>

15:49.990 --> 15:53.370
<b>My wife, her name's Ofusa.</b>

15:53.570 --> 15:57.580
<b>She was the former missus
of Oumiya back in the day.</b>

15:57.790 --> 16:01.120
<b>She's about to hit 40</b>

16:01.330 --> 16:05.340
<b>but she's a restless one, you see?</b>

16:13.260 --> 16:16.350
<b>So what your messenger said was true?</b>

16:17.600 --> 16:20.350
<b>But why? What's going on with Ofusa?</b>

16:21.480 --> 16:23.850
<b>We'll just have to see.</b>

16:25.020 --> 16:27.610
<b>No, I don't believe this.</b>

16:40.330 --> 16:41.910
<b>They're here.</b>

16:59.560 --> 17:02.850
<b>Is that Ofusa?</b>

17:04.100 --> 17:05.350
<b>Ofusa.</b>

17:05.770 --> 17:08.270
<b>Why did you want to break into Oumiya?</b>

17:08.480 --> 17:09.860
<b>Why?</b>

17:10.070 --> 17:12.570
<b>The strong takes from the weak.</b>

17:12.780 --> 17:15.160
<b>That's just how the world works.</b>

17:15.360 --> 17:18.030
<b>However this time, it was important
for me</b>

17:18.240 --> 17:21.700
<b>to have Kakunosuke take Seibei Oumiya's
life</b>

17:21.910 --> 17:24.410
<b>rather than the money.</b>

17:24.620 --> 17:27.500
<b>What makes you resent Oumiya?</b>

17:28.670 --> 17:32.460
<b>Since I have no choice, I'll tell it all.</b>

17:33.760 --> 17:36.630
<b>It was 15 years ago</b>

17:36.840 --> 17:40.970
<b>when I married into the family
of Seibei Oumiya.</b>

17:43.680 --> 17:45.100
<b>I got pregnant right away.</b>

17:45.310 --> 17:50.480
<b>At the time, I felt that the happiness
was going to last forever.</b>

17:50.900 --> 17:54.030
<b>Thank you, Ofusa. Thank you.</b>

17:54.240 --> 17:55.490
<b>My dear.</b>

17:59.740 --> 18:04.160
<b>However, before the child was born...</b>

18:06.750 --> 18:09.040
<b>It was soon after that.</b>

18:09.250 --> 18:11.460
<b>My husband was kicked and killed</b>

18:11.670 --> 18:15.510
<b>by a restless horse on his way
to a business meeting.</b>

18:17.260 --> 18:21.010
<b>The inner workings of a large shop
is a tainted one.</b>

18:21.510 --> 18:23.890
<b>The very next day,</b>

18:24.100 --> 18:27.020
<b>they announced Oumiya's successor
to be</b>

18:27.440 --> 18:33.020
<b>my late husband's younger brother.</b>

18:34.440 --> 18:36.030
<b>After a while...</b>

18:36.740 --> 18:38.030
<b>This kimono.</b>

18:38.240 --> 18:41.780
<b>A good customer complained that it was
uncomfortable to wear.</b>

18:41.990 --> 18:44.990
<b>I looked into and found
that your measurements were wrong.</b>

18:45.200 --> 18:48.000
<b>No, I only did as I was told.</b>

18:48.210 --> 18:49.920
<b>I don't want to hear it.</b>

18:54.630 --> 18:57.220
<b>How could you dirty our precious fabric?</b>

18:57.420 --> 18:59.260
<b>You must've dropped it somewhere.</b>

18:59.470 --> 19:01.220
<b>No, I would never...</b>

19:01.430 --> 19:06.680
<b>You'll hurt our business
with a miserable face like that.</b>

19:07.230 --> 19:10.140
<b>It's been one tragedy after another
since you came.</b>

19:10.350 --> 19:12.400
<b>You must be cursed.</b>

19:12.610 --> 19:15.940
<b>My brother must have died
because of you.</b>

19:16.480 --> 19:19.360
<b>This amount should last you a while.</b>

19:21.530 --> 19:23.450
<b>You understand, right?</b>

19:24.120 --> 19:27.660
<b>He has taken over the Seibei Oumiya
name today.</b>

19:28.750 --> 19:30.160
<b>But by that time,</b>

19:30.670 --> 19:33.290
<b>the estate I used to live in
before I got married</b>

19:33.500 --> 19:36.170
<b>was sold to the government.</b>

19:37.550 --> 19:39.670
<b>That's when I was approached by</b>

19:40.550 --> 19:42.840
<b>Hattori.</b>

19:53.100 --> 19:56.190
<b>As I spent more time with that man,</b>

19:56.400 --> 19:59.150
<b>I had an epiphany</b>

19:59.360 --> 20:01.780
<b>of how the world functioned.</b>

20:01.990 --> 20:06.160
<b>That it was now my turn to steal.</b>

20:06.700 --> 20:08.660
<b>That is all.</b>

20:09.160 --> 20:11.660
<b>You have a grudge against today's
Seibei,</b>

20:11.830 --> 20:14.830
<b>but even a long-standing shop will fall
if it was robbed.</b>

20:15.000 --> 20:18.630
<b>Do you not have any respect
for its predecessors?</b>

20:19.960 --> 20:21.550
<b>What's so funny?</b>

20:21.760 --> 20:23.970
<b>That's not what I was expecting to hear.</b>

20:24.180 --> 20:27.140
<b>Where can I find those predecessors?</b>

20:27.350 --> 20:29.310
<b>They are long gone.</b>

20:29.970 --> 20:35.230
<b>It's foolish to think about those
who aren't in front of you.</b>

20:35.940 --> 20:39.980
<b>Do you have anything else to say?</b>

20:40.610 --> 20:42.570
<b>I don't</b>

20:42.780 --> 20:44.320
<b>have anything.</b>

21:09.810 --> 21:11.430
<b>Women are creatures</b>

21:12.350 --> 21:14.640
<b>who don't live in the past or future.</b>

21:14.850 --> 21:20.440
<b>Seems like we've forgotten how we only
have ourselves in the present.</b>

21:27.280 --> 21:32.250
<b>But I'm still without a home, wife,
kids or money.</b>

21:32.790 --> 21:35.000
<b>All the dreams I entrusted to the sword</b>

21:35.210 --> 21:37.670
<b>have completely vanished.</b>

21:40.250 --> 21:42.210
<b>I see.</b>

21:44.260 --> 21:46.470
<b>Will I see you again?</b>

21:46.680 --> 21:49.680
<b>In exchange for losing Ofusa,</b>

21:49.890 --> 21:52.060
<b>I got to rekindle my friendship with you.</b>

21:52.640 --> 21:54.930
<b>That goes for me too.</b>

21:56.640 --> 21:57.980
<b>I'll see you later.</b>

22:21.130 --> 22:27.300
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.470 --> 22:33.140
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.310 --> 22:39.100
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.440 --> 22:44.860
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.820 --> 22:50.110
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.280 --> 22:54.120
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.290 --> 22:59.170
<b>in my next life</b>

23:00.040 --> 23:05.130
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.960 --> 23:11.340
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:12.050 --> 23:14.970
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.230 --> 23:23.610
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.980 --> 23:32.990
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:42.540 --> 23:44.920
<b>Sudden darkness hits Heizo.</b>

23:45.340 --> 23:48.880
<b>What's the meaning of the
saddened warrior's scent?</b>

23:49.800 --> 23:52.550
<b>Next episode of Onihei
"The Evil Scent of the Hakubaiko"</b>
